This product includes third-party data and software:

IP geolocation data by DB-IP (https://db-ip.com), licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Cloud provider IPv4 ranges: AWS IP ranges (https://ip-ranges.amazonaws.com/ip-ranges.json)
and Google Cloud IP ranges (https://www.gstatic.com/ipranges/cloud.json), used to
identify a server's provider region.

Hosting-network prefixes: derived at build time from the RIPE Stat API
(https://stat.ripe.net, RIPE NCC) for a curated list of hosting ASNs.

Uses the maxminddb crate (MIT licensed).
